==================== DynamoDB: contention, multi-container behaviour, leases, pagination ====================
  PASS  putIfAbsent: exactly one of 40 concurrent claims across 3 containers wins
  PASS  update (optimistic): 45 concurrent increments across 3 containers lose no updates
  PASS  withLock: mutual exclusion across containers (non-atomic read-modify-write stays correct)
  PASS  a live lease blocks other containers; waiting times out with LOCK_TIMEOUT
  PASS  after the dead holder's lease lapses another container takes over
  PASS  query follows pagination (14 x 100 KB items, ~1.4 MB, all returned in order)
  PASS  list(prefix) follows pagination too
  PASS  every write bumps the item version
  PASS  update enforces the item size limit too

>>> dynamo: PASS (9/9 checks)

